text Third period.
text I'm resolved to do a certain something.
text I have to do battle with the teachers every day just to see Kotomi. I can't put myself in a worse situation than before.
text To that end...
text I decide to focus on class until my attention runs out.
text The subject at hand is geography.
sound CAR.aac
text @[Teacher]
text One of the main countries on the Pacific Rim that comes to mind is Australia.
text Australia... I think that's the country with lots of sheep.
sound CAS.aac
text @[Teacher]
text What's the capital of Australia? Anyone?
sound CAT.aac
text @[Student]
text It's Sydney.
sound CAU.aac
text @[Teacher]
text That's the obvious answer, but in reality...
text Oh, Australia's capital isn't Sydney...
text Right... I think I've heard of it before.
text It's like... '
text Trying to ward off sleepiness, I review the few things I know on the subject.
text Um... um...
text That's right. It's Melbourne.
text Mel is the little sister and Bourne is the older brother...
text An evil witch must've turned them into sheep...
text They go through many trials, which the two overcome together... and...
